OL,3,ABurnham says he wants to 'repair
OL,4,Abridges' between Ukraine and US
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said he
OL,7,Fwill try to "repair bridges" between
OL,8,FUkraine and the United States, ahead of
OL,9,Fa meeting with President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky at Downing Street.
OL,12,FThe Ukrainian president was welcomed by
OL,13,Fa military ceremonial guard outside
OL,14,FNumber 10 as he arrived for the
OL,15,Fmeeting, in what is thought to be a
OL,16,Ffirst for a foreign leader.
OL,18,FIt comes after President Donald Trump
OL,19,Fsaid he had struck a deal with Moscow
OL,20,Fto import Russian diesel.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
