OL,3,ABurnham says he wants to 'repair
OL,4,Abridges' between Ukraine and US
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked about Trump's move during Prime
OL,7,FMinister's Questions, Burnham resisted
OL,8,Fcriticising the US president, saying he
OL,9,Fwanted to "be careful in terms of
OL,10,Flaying the ground to bring people back
OL,11,Ftogether".
